{"id":"413532","name":"榨菜丝花蛤粉丝汤","author":"花鱼儿","authorId":"404188","desc":"","cover":"images/413532/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"粉丝","amount":"50克"},{"name":"花蛤","amount":"150克"},{"name":"榨菜丝","amount":"40克"}],"sub":[{"name":"料酒","amount":"适量"},{"name":"盐","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"食材：粉丝、花蛤（已吐完泥沙洗净）、榨菜丝。","img":"images/413532/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"将已洗净的花蛤下入清水锅中，加适量的料酒。","img":"images/413532/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"接着，合入粉丝和榨菜丝煮开煮至花蛤开口。","img":"images/413532/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"然后，加适量的盐。","img":"images/413532/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"调味搅匀即成。","img":"images/413532/step_5.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}